# Installation configuration, not schema. These three seed and amend
# app.AdminAccess, ref.Surveys, app.Settings and ref.PickLists with this
# institution own administrator roster and contact addresses. A copy of the
# application for anyone else should not carry them, and the schema in the
# other sql/ files stands on its own without them.
sql/23_real_people.sql
sql/25_corrections.sql
sql/28_purchase_fixes.sql

